gets, including promotional planning, seasonal phasing, NPD launches, advertising campaigns etc.\n      Define the strategy and joint business plan with our brands to create mutually beneficial sales and marketing plans which grow market share.\n      Represent your brands brilliantly across Marketplaces through best-in-class product content, including but not limited to images, enhanced content, keyword SEO, local language translation, advertising campaigns etc.\n      Conduct analysis of brands performance using multiple data sources and tools on a regular basis to ensure that performance is continuously optimised across all touch points.\n      Manage inventory, working alongside our merchandisers to maintain a healthy pipeline\n      .Establish and maintain relationships with appropriate client partners, providing day-to-day contact on project status and changes.\n      Have a passion for continuous improvement and building and automating processes.\n     \n    \n   \n  \n \n \n  \n   What will I need to thrive in this role?﻿\n   \n    \n     \n      Demonstrated success in managing an ecommerce business\n      5+ years experience in an ecommerce role\n      Strong academic background (2:1 or above)\n      Previous experience managing and growing 3P business on Marketplaces (Amazon and Noon)\n      Creative thinker and problem solver\n      Highly organized and disciplined\n      Willing to be nimble and adaptable to change\n      Able to work under pressure and manage workloads effectively\n      Arabic fluency preferred to facilitate communication with local market clients\n     \n    \n   \n  \n \n \n  \n   We are looking for individuals who are:\n  \n  \n  \n   Game Changers- A game changer is someone who looks at problems with an open mind and shares new ideas with team members, regularly reassesses existing plans and attaches a realistic timeline to goals, makes profitable, productive, and innovative contributions, and actively pursues improvements to Patt