ital Marketing Manager and is responsible for hands-on campaign execution, optimization, testing, and revenue scaling across ecommerce channels. The ideal candidate is analytical, commercially minded, and deeply comfortable inside ad platforms.\n\nKey responsibilities\n• Build, launch and optimize campaigns across Google Ads (Search, Shopping, PMax), Meta Ads Manager, TikTok, Snapchat, Pinterest.\n• Manage performance campaigns across all touchpoints (prospecting, retargeting, retention).\n• Monitor daily performance and take proactive optimization actions towards ROAS, COS, CPA and CR, adjusting bids, budgets, audiences and creatives to hit ROAS targets.\n• Create a tracking (tagging) and reporting system for campaigns/platform performance (attribution, measurement, analytics) and establish KPIs.\n• Develop, conduct, and evaluate A/B tests for creative marketing ideas. Test and optimize landing pages. Create traffic-driving (high relevancy) ads (managing both copywriting and visuals), and execute continuous improvement initiatives.\n• Work closely with ecommerce team to align on targets, improve AOV and CR.\n• Use GA4 and platform data to identify funnel inefficiencies.\n• Manage allocated media budgets responsibly and efficiently, based on performance trends.\n• Conduct deep-dive analytics on multiple datasets to identify opportunities and draft strategic proposals to improve performance (e.g., customer journey review), and swiftly execute approved suggestions.\n• Work with 3rd parties and harness the power of these relationships to facilitate both traffic and conversion growth.\n• Build weekly and monthly performance reports with actionable insights, translating campaign data into clear growth opportunities.\n• Execute locally relevant performance campaigns for Ramadan, Eid, National Days and key cultural moments.\n• Adapt global creatives for Arabic-first audiences while maintaining brand integrity.\n• Monitor creative performance across languages and markets.\n