tional discipline, good judgment, attention to detail, and the ability to move quickly without becoming messy.\n**What You'll Own**\n-------------------\n\n\n### **Social Media Execution**\n\n\n* Manage OneAsset's day\\-to\\-day presence across X, LinkedIn, and Instagram\n* Draft, schedule, and publish content aligned with brand priorities and tone\n* Adapt approved ideas into platform\\-native content formats\n* Monitor post performance and flag useful insights or adjustments\n\n### **Community Growth \\& Engagement**\n\n\n* Build and maintain a high\\-quality community around the brand\n* Reply, engage, moderate, and keep conversations active and relevant\n* Identify and onboard aligned community members, contributors, and supporters\n* Surface useful community feedback, recurring themes, and strong voices internally\n* Moderate spam and maintain signal quality across public\\-facing channels\n\n### **Campaign \\& Quest Operations**\n\n\n* Execute community and growth campaigns across platforms such as Galxe, Zealy, or similar tools\n* Support contributor / ambassador programs, including task posting, tracking, approvals, and check\\-ins\n* Keep campaign timelines, mechanics, and participation flows organised\n* Ensure campaign execution is clean, timely, and properly tracked\n\n### **X Spaces \\& Guest Pipeline**\n\n\n* Organise X Spaces end\\-to\\-end, including topics, guest outreach, confirmations, run\\-of\\-show, and recap\n* Build and maintain a usable pipeline of relevant KOLs, guests, and ecosystem collaborators\n* Support first\\-touch outreach and follow\\-up for Spaces and campaign participation\n* Keep all outreach and guest tracking updated and visible\n\n### **Community Support During MVP / Campaign Phases**\n\n\n* Support Discord and community activity during active MVP or campaign windows\n* Help onboard contributors or testers into the right channels and flows\n* Support announcements, participation reminders, and feedback collection where needed