 to create basic visuals, resise assets, or prepare draft content when needed\n* Comfortable working with Notion, Google Sheets, Slack, Lark, or similar collaboration tools\n\n### **Judgment \\& Fit**\n\n\n* Strong judgment on what to post, what to engage with, and what is worth amplifying\n* Able to distinguish signal from noise in Web3 and financial\\-market conversations\n* High ownership, low ego, and strong accountability\n* Learns quickly, takes feedback well, and improves fast\n* Comfortable moving fast without becoming sloppy\n* Good with people, able to engage a community naturally while staying professional\n\n\n**Nice to Have**\n----------------\n\n\n* Experience in RWAs, tokenisation, real estate, DeFi, or broader digital asset markets\n* Experience with KOL sourcing, guest outreach, and campaign collaborations\n* Basic analytics and reporting ability across social and community channels\n\n\n**Weekly Deliverables**\n-----------------------\n\n\n* Social posting and channel execution across owned platforms\n* Community engagement, moderation, and quality onboarding\n* Guest outreach and X Spaces pipeline management\n* Weekly report submitted every Friday\n* Campaign / quest operations and contributor tracking\n* Tracker hygiene maintained across outreach, submissions, approvals, and statuses\n\n**Biweekly Deliverables**\n-------------------------\n\n\n* 1 X Space end\\-to\\-end, including topic, guests, ops, and recap within 24 hours\n\n**Community / Campaign Support Deliverables**\n---------------------------------------------\n\n\n* Discord and community support during active MVP or campaign phases\n* Contributor support, participation reminders, and feedback loop assistance where required",
