 and business opportunities.\n• Partner with Consumer & Market Insights (CMI) to gather behavioural, attitudinal, and olfactive learnings.\n• Synthesize insights into clear strategic recommendations for internal and client teams.\n\n2. Concept Creation & Category Storytelling\n• Translate market and consumer insights into engaging concepts, visuals, and fragrance directions.\n• Drive the creation of proactive marketing tools, trend stories, and promotional materials.\n• Craft compelling and visually rich narratives that connect olfactive directions to consumer emotions and needs.\n• Ensure all marketing deliverables harmonize with Givaudan branding and creative guidelines.\n• Support technologies, ingredients, and fragrance launches with strong storytelling and category relevance.\n\n3. Client Partnership & Experience Creation\n• Create and deliver tailored, high-impact presentations for key clients across the region.\n• Lead immersive client experiences—workshops, market immersions, innovation sessions and displays, conceptualizing corporate stands for trade shows and exhibitions while managing agencies during design and fabrication stages\n• Collaborate with Sales, Evaluation, and Creation to align on fragrance directions that strengthen our winning strategy in briefs.\n• Position Givaudan as a strategic partner by identifying opportunities that differentiate the client's brand.\n• Support occasional global client projects, representing MENA consumer and market perspective.\n\n4. Cross-Functional Collaboration\n• Work closely with the Creation, Evaluation, CMI, Sampling, Sales, and Communications teams to deliver unified, high-quality outputs.\n• Engage with the global marketing community to share MENA insights and ensure alignment with worldwide initiatives.\n• Contribute to internal category knowledge building and support regional and global marketing programs.\n\n5. Project Management & Continuous Improvement\n• Manage multiple marketing projects from briefing 