oster a culture of excellence, accountability, and continuous improvement.\n* Prepare business review meeting (BRM) presentations, Execution Plans and executive management material, ad hoc reports for the MD or VTI management\n* Provide leadership aligned with the company’s mission, vision, and values.\n* Active compliance control towards business functions as well as staff functions, hereunder; Export control and sanctions, Data Privacy, Anti\\-corruption and Fair competition.\n* Drive, support and follow up activities linked to capital efficiency, optimal local \\& consolidated top\\-/bottom\\- line.\n* In the CMT as JC Financial Manager oversee the Volvo Groups investments, IT infrastructure coordination, general cost control, bank connections and accounting, together with the FCA director under a 4 eyes principle. Secure we take data\\-based decisions.\n**Key Responsibilities**\n------------------------\n\n**Financial Planning \\& Performance Management**\n\n* Lead and manage financial planning, budgeting, forecasting, and reporting processes.\n* Monitor short\\- and long\\-term financial targets and performance.\n* Produce accurate market financials (actuals, forecasts, estimates, business plans).\n* Oversee regional cash flow management and financial health.\n\n**Business Control \\& Strategy Execution**\n\n* Translate sales area strategies into actionable financial and operational plans tailored to local markets.\n* Develop tools, action plans, and KPIs to drive profitability and efficiency.\n* Provide insights and recommendations to senior management on financial performance.\n* Support development of new business strategies, segments, and market initiatives.\n\n**Operational \\& Functional Leadership**\n\n* Lead the Business Control function across the business area and staff functions.\n* Drive capital efficiency and break\\-even optimization initiatives.\n* Prepare Business Review Management (BRM) and executive\\-level presentations.\n* Promote continuous