M campaigns, analyzing metrics such as pipeline contribution, ROI, qualified contacts, and engagement rates\nProvide detailed post-campaign reporting and actionable insights to sales leadership and marketing stakeholders\nMaintain accurate campaign tracking in HubSpot and Salesforce with proper attribution\nContinuously refine campaigns based on data-driven insights to optimize performance and outcomes\n\n\nSkills & requirements\n\n5 years of experience in B2B field marketing or demand generation, preferably within SaaS, FinTech, or enterprise software\nProven event planning and execution experience including managing logistics, vendor relationships, and on-site event coordination\nBDR/SDR or sales development background preferred – understanding of prospecting, outreach, and sales collaboration dynamics\nProven ability to design and execute integrated marketing programs that deliver measurable pipeline results\nExperience working with enterprise sales teams targeting C-level executives\nExperience with marketing automation platforms (HubSpot preferred) and CRM systems (Salesforce)\nStrong project management and organizational skills with the ability to manage multiple priorities effectively\nExcellent communication and interpersonal skills with a collaborative approach to working across teams\nBudget management experience with demonstrated ability to prove marketing ROI\nCreative mindset with experience designing memorable engagement tactics (gifting, direct mail, experiential marketing)\n\n\nPreferred qualifications\n\n2 years of ABM experience with familiarity with ABM tools like 6sense or Demandbase\nExperience marketing to CFOs, Treasurers, Controllers, or finance personas\nKnowledge of treasury management, payments, or financial technology solutions\nUnderstanding of regional business practices and compliance considerations\nA data-driven mindset with proficiency in marketing analytics and reporting tools\nExperience with AI-powered content tools (Jasper, Tofu